      #|  !k (r:K->A ring) x y.\n        ring_associates (product_ring k r) x y <=>\n        EXTENSIONAL k x /\\ EXTENSIONAL k y /\\\n        !i. i IN k ==> ring_associates (r i) (x i) (y i)
