      #|  !(f:K->A ring) k l.\n        DISJOINT k l\n        ==> ring_isomorphisms\n                (product_ring (k UNION l) f,\n                 prod_ring (product_ring k f) (product_ring l f))\n                ((\\f. RESTRICTION k f,RESTRICTION l f),\n                 (\\(f,g) x. if x IN k then f x else g x))
      #|  !(f:K->A ring) k l.\n        DISJOINT k l\n        ==> ring_isomorphism\n                (product_ring (k UNION l) f,\n                 prod_ring (product_ring k f) (product_ring l f))\n                (\\f. RESTRICTION k f,RESTRICTION l f)
      #|  (i:K) INSERT k = {i} UNION k
