      #|  x IN ring_carrier r /\\ y IN ring_carrier r\n    ==> ring_mul r (if p then x else ring_0 r)\n                    (if q then y else ring_0 r) =\n        (if p /\\ q then ring_mul r x y else ring_0 r)
      #|  m:V->num
